  - statementId: 2
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: Oh yes! Actually, I am a part-timer. I am quite ashamed to say that I don't really know much. However, I am pretty confident when it comes to the food business like cofee and deserts. I can really make good coffee! If everything goes along fine,  I want to run a coffee shop of my own. It is sad to see that the situation in the city is chaotic. Part of our contribution to help eliminate the disorder are recycling works. It is really difficult that why we need people in the community to help. Student, would you be willing to collect recyclable rubbish in exchange for Ice-Cream? Do you want to try?
      condition:
        isEnable: 1
        classRequiremnet:
          brawlerMale: 1
          swordsmanMale: 1
          archerMale: 1
          shamanMale: 1
